B.a0O=new A.aq("How do opponents join a private match?","Each match creates a short room code and shareable link. Your opponent signs in, enters the code in the hero bar or Duels lobby, and takes Side B.")
B.a1a=new A.aq("How do 5-player Blitz brackets work?","Blitz brackets run across five entry tiers. Once 5 players join a queue for a specific game, the bracket starts automatically and settles the payout after the final.")
B.a1f=new A.aq("How are rankings and ELO handled across the 21 games?","Every game maintains its own independent ELO rating (Level 1\u201310) and leaderboard. Your rating in EA Sports FC 27 never mixes with Counter-Strike 2 or Chess.")
B.a0K=new A.aq("Why is Playverzus piloting in Kenya first, and is it ready for global players?","Kenya leads the world in instant mobile-money adoption, making it the ideal live proving ground for real-time competitive escrow. While our Phase 1 pilot settles in KES via M-PESA, our global Visa/Mastercard and USDC settlement rails via Crossmint are already built and ready to activate worldwide.")
B.a0N=new A.aq("How can game developers integrate their own games?","Register a Game Developer account, select your game's target platforms (PC, Console, Mobile, Web), and provide your Stats API endpoint and JSON field paths. Playverzus fetches live player stats and match results server-side.")
